body:

**Industrial Engineer, MSc, BSc**

<p class="contact-line">Email: <a href="mailto:thabangkeele@gmail.com">thabangkeele@gmail.com</a> · Tel: +27 73 524 8105 · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thabang-keele/">LinkedIn</a> · <a href="https://github.com/thabangkeele">GitHub</a></p>

## Summary

Over a decade experience, leveraging Python and the Microsoft cloud ecosystem to optimize end-to-end supply chain operations, from manufacturing and inventory to transportation and retail.
My focus is optimising processes, workflows, and building predictive models that drive strategic decision-making. I am particularly passionate about Operations Research topics and their applications in decision-making under uncertainty.

I enjoy exploring non-obvious applications of tools and analytical frameworks; those counterintuitive detours are often where complex concepts finally click.

Curious by default, and fascinated by everything I do.

## Experience

### Core Group

<p class="role-note">South Africa's longest-standing Apple distributor.</p>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Industrial Engineer, Supply Chain & Inventory Management</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Jan 2026 to Present</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Analysing inventory flows and demand patterns across distribution channels to identify replenishment policy improvements that reduce holding costs without compromising fill rates.</li>
    <li>Designing and implementing process improvements across ordering and replenishment.</li>
    <li>Maintaining and writing code supporting core supply chain processes, driving team efficiencies.</li>
    <li>Automating reporting across all African operations.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

### Caterpillar Inc.

<p class="role-note">Global manufacturer of construction and mining equipment, engines and industrial power systems.</p>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Parts Operations Consultant</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Feb 2025 to Oct 2025</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Led implementation of Caterpillar's Parts Excellence Program across dealer networks, assessing operations to improve consistency with global best practices.</li>
    <li>Partnered with aftermarket sales teams to feed market intelligence into inventory planning, improving parts availability and dealer profitability.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

### Motus Aftermarket Parts

<p class="role-note">Aftermarket parts division of Motus Holdings, South Africa's largest automotive group.</p>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Senior Supply Chain Business Analyst</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Nov 2023 to Feb 2025</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Led functional specification development for a Microsoft Dynamics 365 and Syncron implementation, shaping how the business would manage procurement and demand planning.</li>
    <li>Managed a demand forecasting and inventory control simulation across 140,000 SKUs in 84 locations, selecting optimal replenishment policies by category.</li>
    <li>Led a customer classification and network optimisation project across 60 retail locations to reduce cost-to-serve, and built a promotions forecasting model that improved availability across 4,500 SKUs.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Senior Business Analyst, Analytics</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Apr 2022 to Nov 2023</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Acted as Supply Chain Data Steward, bridging supply chain, operations, ICT and finance; built the data glossary and a data-quality auditing system.</li>
    <li>Built Power BI dashboards, data models and paginated reports that replaced fragmented spreadsheets, giving executives real-time visibility across the business.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Senior Supply Chain Analyst</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Jun 2020 to Mar 2022</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Led optimisation of group inventory policies, efficiently managing a R2 billion stock holding through improved replenishment logic.</li>
    <li>Developed a robust S&OP framework that replaced ad hoc planning with structured demand-supply alignment.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

### Pick n Pay Supply Chain

<p class="role-note">Supply chain division of Pick n Pay, one of South Africa's largest retail grocery chains.</p>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Transportation Analyst</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Nov 2018 to May 2020</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Built a transport network simulation grouping optimal route-store combinations, reducing delivery times and costs.</li>
    <li>Automated daily, weekly and monthly transport KPI reports and scheduling scripts, removing manual effort and error from a high-frequency planning process.</li>
</div>

### Novus Holdings Ltd

<p class="role-note">South Africa's largest commercial printing and manufacturing group, listed on the JSE.</p>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Industrial Engineer</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Jul 2014 to Oct 2018</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Managed the industrial engineering workstream on a R220 million paper mill and converting line acquisition, lifting paper output from 550 to 900 tons per year and tissue capacity from 340 to 600 tons per year.</li>
    <li>Built a full-stack management information system (HTML, PHP, SQL) for the new tissue business, enabling real-time data collection and reporting from launch.</li>
    <li>Designed the tissue warehouse layout, developed production KPIs, and ran internal audits for best-practice adherence.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

### Benteler Automotive SA

<p class="role-note">German automotive components supplier to VW, BMW and other global OEMs.</p>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Industrial Engineer</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Feb 2013 to Apr 2013</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Value Stream Mapped VW and BMW production lines across two Johannesburg plants, identifying waste and improvement opportunities.</li>
    <li>Designed and ran Kaizen workshops for foremen and press operators, building continuous-improvement capability.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

### University of the Witwatersrand

<p class="role-note">One of South Africa's leading research universities.</p>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Student Consultant, Wits Solar Car Project</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Feb 2012 to Dec 2012</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Developed the project plan, schedule and stakeholder communication framework, keeping a multi-disciplinary team aligned.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Student Consultant, Centre for Mechanised Mining Systems</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Feb 2012 to Jul 2012</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Researched and designed interactive learning resources for Industrial Engineering, pioneering a new teaching approach.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

### OIM Operations Solutions

<p class="role-note">Operations consulting firm specialising in process improvement for industrial clients.</p>

<div class="role">
  <div class="role-header">
    <span class="role-title">Student Industrial Engineer</span>
    <span class="role-dates">Oct 2011 to Feb 2012</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Analysed and mapped client data capture workflows through time and motion studies,
    documenting granular process steps and standardising procedures.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

## Education

**University of the Witwatersrand**

- MSc Industrial Engineering (2021)
- BSc Industrial Engineering (2013)

## Certifications

- Microsoft Certified: Power BI Data Analyst Associate, Microsoft (2023)
- Certified Supply Chain Analyst (CSCA), ISCEA (2020)

## Skills

**Technical:** SQL · Python · Power BI · Tableau · MS Excel · AMPL · HTML/PHP

**Systems:** Microsoft Dynamics 365 · Syncron · SAP ERP & BW · Azure Synapse · MySQL · SQL Server · Syspro · One Network

**Methodologies:** Lean · Kaizen · Value Stream Mapping · S&OP Planning · Operations Research Methods

**Interested in:** Strategic Management · Probability and Uncertainty Modelling · Operations Research · Supply Chain Optimisation